@nikhy_ridecycle_HostAddress = https://localhost:7275

### 1. Create a New Ride (Day 1)
POST {{nikhy_ridecycle_HostAddress}}/api/rides
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": 2001,
  "passengerId": 501,
  "pickupLocation": "Connaught Place, New Delhi",
  "destinationLocation": "IGI Airport Terminal 3, New Delhi",
  "pickupLatitude": 28.6315,
  "pickupLongitude": 77.2167,
  "destinationLatitude": 28.5562,
  "destinationLongitude": 77.1000,
  "fare": 480.00,
  "distance": 16.5,
  "estimatedDuration": 38
}

### 2. Get Ride Details by ID
GET {{nikhy_ridecycle_HostAddress}}/api/rides/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Accept Ride (Driver Assignment - Day 2)
POST {{nikhy_ridecycle_HostAddress}}/api/rides/2/accept?driverId=301
Accept: application/json

### 4. Driver is Arriving (Status Update)
POST {{nikhy_ridecycle_HostAddress}}/api/rides/3/arriving
Accept: application/json

### 5. Driver Arrived at Pickup
POST {{nikhy_ridecycle_HostAddress}}/api/rides/4/arrived
Accept: application/json

### 6. Start Ride (Day 3)
POST {{nikhy_ridecycle_HostAddress}}/api/rides/5/start
Accept: application/json

### 7. Complete Ride
POST {{nikhy_ridecycle_HostAddress}}/api/rides/6/complete
Accept: application/json

### 8. Cancel Ride
POST {{nikhy_ridecycle_HostAddress}}/api/rides/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer requested cancellation - change of plans",
  "cancelledBy": "Passenger"
}

### 9. Get Ride History (Paginated & Filterable)
GET {{nikhy_ridecycle_HostAddress}}/api/rides/history?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 10. Filter Ride History by Passenger
GET {{nikhy_ridecycle_HostAddress}}/api/rides/history?passengerId=101&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### 11. Filter Ride History by Status
GET {{nikhy_ridecycle_HostAddress}}/api/rides/history?status=COMPLETED&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json
